00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.520
Jack: There are many different coding
languages used in programming, let’s have

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.170
a look at some of the more popular ones.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.560
Leah: Python

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:11.869
Python is an interpreted high-level
general-purpose programming language.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:16.589
It is object oriented and used in
everything from developing application

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:21.580
programming interfaces or API’s,
to being incorporated into machine

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:27.200
learning and data analytics via third
party plug ins like SciPY and Panda.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.639
Python has been used to create
everything from Netflix's recommendation

00:00:31.679 --> 00:00:35.099
algorithm to the software that
controls self-driving cars.

00:00:36.499 --> 00:00:37.229
Jack: JavaScript

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:42.270
JavaScript often tops the list of the most
popular programming languages due to its

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.640
continuous use in open-source projects.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:48.280
It is a dynamic and interpreted
programming language with

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:51.820
object-oriented capabilities,
that's used for web applications,

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:53.689
game development and lots more.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.480
It allows for creating dynamic
features on web pages that cannot

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.830
be done with only HTML and CSS.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:01.580
Leah: Java

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:07.880
Java is a general purpose, class based,
object-oriented programming language

00:01:08.009 --> 00:01:12.880
designed for application development and
has less implementation dependencies.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.630
It is secure, fast, and reliable.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:20.399
It is widely used for developing
applications in laptops, data centres,

00:01:20.559 --> 00:01:22.479
games consoles and mobile phones.

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:26.030
It is essentially the parent of
Java Script and is now mostly

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:27.659
associated with game developers.

00:01:28.279 --> 00:01:31.800
It's an open source and a popular
choice for creative coding.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:32.880
Jack: C++

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:39.369
C++ is a general-purpose programming
language based on the older language C.

00:01:40.059 --> 00:01:44.349
It is used in one way or another in every
complex system in the world from Operating

00:01:44.349 --> 00:01:46.190
Systems to Government mainframes.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.450
Even Google uses this
programming language for its most

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.170
resource intensive operations.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:57.679
Internet of Things [IoT] devices also
make use of C++, and it is useful for

00:01:57.679 --> 00:02:00.070
building complex open-source systems.

00:02:00.969 --> 00:02:01.169
Leah: C#

00:02:02.559 --> 00:02:07.490
C# is another object-oriented language
commonly used in game developing.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:12.520
A member of the 'C' language family
it shares similar logic to C++

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:16.080
but is regarded as easier to use.

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:20.110
It is commonly used for Windows
applications, and it’s recommended for

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:22.180
building games on the ‘Unity’ engine.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:28.480
The language’s specific syntax makes
it easy for 3D development, so is

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:31.005
good for making VR applications.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:32.210
Jack: SQL

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:36.710
SQL stands for Structured
Query Language and is used to

00:02:36.719 --> 00:02:38.210
communicate with a database.

00:02:38.849 --> 00:02:44.340
For those who wish to work with databases
SQL is ideal as it is a very practical

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:48.650
language and easy to use and uses a
syntax that is similar to English which

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.670
helps to create a smooth learning curve.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:52.310
Leah: Scala

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:56.499
Scala is another popular
programming language often

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.500
seen as an alternative to Java.

00:02:59.129 --> 00:03:04.730
It is a multi- paradigm general purpose
programme, supporting both object oriented

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:09.230
and functional programming and can be
applied to many areas of development.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:10.370
Jack: Ruby

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:14.470
Ruby is regarded as simple
to learn and a good starting

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:15.859
place for budding developers.

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:19.570
It is most often used to build
websites and web applications.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.000
Leah: Swift

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:25.230
Swift is a relatively new language
that has a strong following due

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:28.160
to the convenience it offers
to open-source developers.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.309
It is behind most modern iOS applications.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:32.300
Jack: PHP

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.210
PHP is a programming language
mostly used for web development.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:42.230
It is a simple language with logic and
syntax that can be mastered quite quickly.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.970
It is used for WordPress websites
and platforms like Facebook.

